{"candidate_identity":"a73e3e145d849b44fba0ccd6cd6c90c9d60dbaf405c6b9399f0a04b36370fb46","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d5aaeb2eb8595ee85f2b44d6e2b98fb641d64f501000ee81a659886df2d8e99","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9447c0966c4d09fdb0e75e51b7685c53e5301a6d26cf0afc951bb0784ba266d3","logical_entry_identity":"370166aae6260af93512a866eaf6bf25d6eed4e4beaa42f57e12b91c3e4e7d1f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Continuously swing your steamsaws around you, dealing %d%% weapon damage to adjacent foes each time you attack.\n\t\tYour chaotic motions make it difficult for anything to hit you, granting %d%% chance to completely negate all damage.\n\t\tDamage avoidance chance increases with Steampower.\n\t\t#{italic}#Make the metal talk!#{normal}#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"持续挥舞你的链锯，每次你攻击时对周围敌人造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t你狂乱的动作使你很难被命中，%d%% 几率无视伤害。\n\t\t伤害无效概率随蒸汽强度提高。\n\t\t#{italic}#感受金属之怒吧！！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b37989f048cae4f239c20b0b6c2081e2c01a17e84a2fdb2a806a029f0b477006","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9456b8ab717da931eadbad69b558887d853b6ca3741ae655316f1a78ea3eb2d1","logical_entry_identity":"31dbb0b723052f21ac90ab9681e85d6ef52d88cc92f378b4a52c491967f6f059","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Vulnerable to more cross tier effects.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"会受到更多跨层效果影响。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9257519e153f59042e8099cc7918e13fae2cdf493849b6779dad21781810f85e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"94628429cce37494abc529cfb3be1172ccb5cfbb610f81b5fe3786739285d2f4","logical_entry_identity":"2dbf994671ba348af281c0ad8399160d348e19048aeb43aeb242db62e531b1f6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"\"Have you ever looked at some guys and thought 'you know, I really wish they were on fire right now', but you didn't feel like walking all the way over there? Well, there's now a better way!\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"你是否曾经看到一些人并且想：“你知道吗，我真的想要烧死这些人”，但是你又不想大费周章，现在有了一个更加方便的方法！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fca6ab42bdf8f48db2f1f562c98b776f62e9c37c4e8f2c830c9c95994b20e5a1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9470e8b26683157c52d5333b151728f999b2de44f88c058e71104a7c1c109cdd","logical_entry_identity":"5829d6f5f92ca35454512ebd55fbf335c2b29c46cdff5f6c9812e589609113c8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You arrive in a maze of shifty sand tunnels.\nBut you have with you the power of technology! You have been given a #GOLD#Stralite Sand Shredder#LAST#. Use it to dig yourself a path should there be none to be found.\n#{italic}#Simply walk into a wall with the shredder equipped and the sand will crumble before you!#{normal}#\n\nBeware to not draw too much attention to yourself, and do not forget to collect the eggs!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你到达了一片由沙子形成的不断变化的通道构成的迷宫。\n但是这一次，你有了科技的力量！你得到了一套#GOLD#斯莱特掘沙者#LAST#。若没有现成的通道，就用它为自己挖出一条路来。\n#{italic}#只需要装备着掘沙者走向沙墙，这面沙墙就会在你面前坍塌！#{normal}#\n\n小心不要引起太多注意，也不要忘了收集里奇虫卵！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b1ac545a5b4eb88153a6ee262eef3d206dc5350d66f8fb617ea7c3bf768bff9","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9484e1480eaf8aba6d9753b3b47f35024034c7f3954d75c558a7e7ec9d652d3d","logical_entry_identity":"3337e54431e3a1b5cc22d4cd75625ee442a88c809a0d9c195cba233190153324","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"volatile fuel","source_tag":"damage type","target":"易燃燃料"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c5bf12b1bebd960b3bcac1ca2b15f5d7bf3cfa360bf8d903c6e670444a8981ae","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"94a9d31de601b154574a2b4c81b76c72c514be28b507de9a2871762b16abb03e","logical_entry_identity":"6ed2324b2891c50d6b4f01968335e91f81af35412726e04d028d47617b4b35ef","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"A dedicated technician seems to have built pockets of spider venom into these rounds. It's not clear how happy the spiders were about this.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位热心的技师似乎将成吨的蜘蛛毒液注入了这些子弹里。不知道蜘蛛对此有多么高兴。"},{"